<title>USA: Stanley sells one unit, retains another.</title>
<headline>Stanley sells one unit, retains another.</headline>
<dateline>NEW BRITAIN, Conn. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stanley Works said on Tuesday it completed the sale of its Garage-Related Products unit to Whistler Corp of Chelmsford, Mass., for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>Garage-Related Products, formerly part of Stanley Door Systems, makes garage doors, garage-door openers and related products.</p>
<p>Stanley also said it will retain its Office Products unit, which previously was targeted for sale.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
